redfin 1216: Touch ID match bound to the MatchMode's ACM context, kern.sweet_mesa_acm_bind (default 0)

MatchMode payload (libBKDM1 performMatchCommand:): +0 processedFlags, +4 user, +8 u32 ACM context length and +0xc its
external form for forCredentialSet ops. With the switch on, such a match adds BiometryMatched to that context only
(record bit 6 CredentialAdded) and does not unlock the keybag; matches without a context unlock the keybag and arm
no ACM credential. Off: 1198/1205 behaviour (global 5 s arm, every match unlocks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013SvAC4dCbJuYfzxCtCk4D8
